{
 "title": "Gold",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Gold",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c072",
     "shot": "gd_mill",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "January 24th, 1848.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "c073",
     "shot": "gd_mill",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "James Marshall is building a sawmill for his boss, John Sutter.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "c074",
     "shot": "gd_mill",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In the water, something shines.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "sparkle",
       "w:shines.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c075",
     "shot": "gd_mill",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "*Gold.*",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Gold.",
       0.6
      ],
      [
       "hit",
       "w:Gold.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c076",
     "shot": "gd_novel",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Remember the novel?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c077",
     "shot": "gd_novel",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The island where the only metal was gold?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c078",
     "shot": "gd_novel",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "338 years later, the made-up story came true.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:338",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c079",
     "shot": "gd_secret",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Sutter begged everyone to keep it secret.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c080",
     "shot": "gd_secret",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It stayed secret for about five minutes.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       0,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c081",
     "shot": "gd_brannan",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Because a shopkeeper named Sam Brannan heard the news,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c082",
     "shot": "gd_brannan",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and before he told a single person, he quietly bought up every pick,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:pick,",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c083",
     "shot": "gd_brannan",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "pan, and shovel he could find.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:pan,",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "pop",
       "w:shovel",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "kaching",
       "end",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c084",
     "shot": "gd_shout",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Then, the story goes, he ran through the streets of San Francisco,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c085",
     "shot": "gd_shout",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "waving a bottle of gold dust and shouting,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c086",
     "shot": "gd_shout",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Gold! Gold from the American River!",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Gold!",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c087",
     "shot": "gd_boom",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "San Francisco had about 1,000 people.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c088",
     "shot": "gd_boom",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Two years later, it had *25,000.*",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       0,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c089",
     "shot": "gd_ships",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Sailors jumped off their ships and ran for the hills.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "waves"
    },
    {
     "id": "c090",
     "shot": "gd_ships",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Hundreds of empty ships sat rotting in the bay.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "waves"
    },
    {
     "id": "c091",
     "shot": "gd_ships",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Some were dragged ashore and turned into hotels.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "waves",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:hotels.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c092",
     "shot": "gd_world",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "They came from everywhere.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c093",
     "shot": "gd_world",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "China, Chile, Mexico, Australia, France,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "tick",
       "w:China,",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "tick",
       "w:Chile,",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "tick",
       "w:Mexico,",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "tick",
       "w:Australia,",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "tick",
       "w:France,",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c094",
     "shot": "gd_world",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "around *300,000* people in seven years.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c095",
     "shot": "gd_prices",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "An egg could cost a dollar.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "kaching",
       "w:dollar.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c096",
     "shot": "gd_prices",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "A shovel could cost a small fortune.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c097",
     "shot": "gd_state",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "California skipped the waiting line completely.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boing",
       10,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c098",
     "shot": "gd_state",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1850, it became the 31st state.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:31st",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c099",
     "shot": "gd_quiet",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "But the hills were not empty.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c100",
     "shot": "gd_quiet",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Around 150,000 Native people lived in California when the gold was found.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c101",
     "shot": "gd_quiet",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "By 1870, about 30,000 were left.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c102",
     "shot": "gd_quiet",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Disease, hunger, and killing that the new state paid for.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c103",
     "shot": "gd_quiet",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Its first governor told lawmakers to expect a war of extermination.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c104",
     "shot": "gd_quiet",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In 2019, the governor of California stood in front of tribal leaders",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c105",
     "shot": "gd_quiet",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "and called it what it was.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c106",
     "shot": "gd_quiet",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "A genocide.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c107",
     "shot": "gd_quiet",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And he apologized.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c108",
     "shot": "gd_men",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And the men who started it all?",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c109",
     "shot": "gd_men",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Sutter's workers ran off to dig.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c110",
     "shot": "gd_men",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Strangers took over his land.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c111",
     "shot": "gd_men",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "He died still asking Congress for help.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c112",
     "shot": "gd_men",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Marshall, the man who saw the gold first,",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c113",
     "shot": "gd_men",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "ended up selling his own autograph to get by.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c114",
     "shot": "gd_who",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "So if the finder didn't get rich,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c115",
     "shot": "gd_who",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and the landowner didn't get rich,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c116",
     "shot": "gd_who",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "who did?",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:who",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c117",
     "shot": "gd_who",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Remember the shopkeeper.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c118",
     "shot": "gd_who",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "We'll come back to him.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}